# Apocalypse Nigh (jeuno 89): the available check's operands one at a time, at Ru'Lude Gardens' trigger area 1 (a walk
# from z 100). Two level 75 Warriors.
# - main: Shadows of the Departed accepted: no section (its own accepted area handler: no sliver: nil): nothing.
#   Completed (a GM), the Timer 8001 (a GM; day 8000): nothing. The Timer 8000 (today): the available check holds: the
#   trade while only available, a Static Earring to Gilgamesh in Norg: no onTrade anywhere (no script): nothing; back
#   in area 1: 123 (Timer = day), begun. The main flow's Timer 0 is the side under the day.
# - other: Shadows of the Departed completed, the mustZone set by a GM (Quest[3][89]mustZone 243, as Shadows of the
#   Departed's 162 leaves it): nothing; out to Upper Jeuno and back (cleared): 123, begun.
lists RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/123 Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrade
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=4,2.5,100 job=WAR lvl=75
char other zone=RuludeGardens pos=4,2.5,100 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.ShadowsOfTheDeparted accepted
item StaticEarring
other: quest Jeuno.ShadowsOfTheDeparted completed
other: charvar Quest[3][89]mustZone 243
login
tick 3000                               # the zone-in lock (2.5 s) keeps trigger areas off
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Shadows of the Departed accepted: no section; nothing
walk 4,2.5,100
quest Jeuno.ShadowsOfTheDeparted completed  # a GM
charvar Quest[3][89]Timer 8001          # a GM
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Timer 8001 > day 8000: no section; nothing
walk 4,2.5,100
charvar Quest[3][89]Timer 8000          # a GM: today
warp 120.9,-8,-12 Norg                  # by Gilgamesh
trade Gilgamesh StaticEarring x1        # available: no onTrade: nothing
warp 4,2.5,100 RuludeGardens
tick 3000
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Timer 8000 = day 8000: 123
finish                                  # begun
other: login
tick 3000
other: walk 4,2.5,60                    # the mustZone set: no section; nothing
other: warp -55.5,8.2,97.5 UpperJeuno   # another zone: the mustZone cleared
other: warp 4,2.5,100 RuludeGardens
tick 3000
other: walk 4,2.5,60                    # 123
other: finish                           # begun
